  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">REVIVE Plus</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">REVIVE Plus will provide country-level early recovery interventions that are built around five outputs: infrastructure rehabilitation, mine action and debris and waste management; livelihoods and local economy; enabled local planning for early recovery; solutions for forcibly displaced populations; stabilization and reintegration support. These interventions are designed to help communities restore basic living conditions, regain access to services and infrastructure, restart economic activity,</narrative>
  </description>
